      "body": "<p><span class='m'>ABC</span> — teng tomonli uchburchak. Ichki nuqtalar <span class='m'>A<sub>1</sub></span>, <span class='m'>B<sub>1</sub></span>, <span class='m'>C<sub>1</sub></span> uchun <span class='m'>BA<sub>1</sub> = A<sub>1</sub>C</span>, <span class='m'>CB<sub>1</sub> = B<sub>1</sub>A</span>, <span class='m'>AC<sub>1</sub> = C<sub>1</sub>B</span> va</p><div class='box'><span class='m'>∠BA<sub>1</sub>C + ∠CB<sub>1</sub>A + ∠AC<sub>1</sub>B = 480°</span></div><p><span class='m'>A<sub>2</sub> = BC<sub>1</sub> ∩ CB<sub>1</sub></span>, <span class='m'>B<sub>2</sub> = CA<sub>1</sub> ∩ AC<sub>1</sub></span>, <span class='m'>C<sub>2</sub> = AB<sub>1</sub> ∩ BA<sub>1</sub></span>.</p><svg width='900' height='375' viewBox='0 0 900 375' style='display:block;margin:0 auto 14px'><line x1='450.0' y1='40.2' x2='270.0' y2='352.0' stroke='#eef2f7' stroke-width='4' /><line x1='270.0' y1='352.0' x2='630.0' y2='352.0' stroke='#eef2f7' stroke-width='4' /><line x1='630.0' y1='352.0' x2='450.0' y2='40.2' stroke='#eef2f7' stroke-width='4' /><line x1='270.0' y1='352.0' x2='557.0' y2='269.7' stroke='#f2b84b' stroke-width='2.5' /><line x1='630.0' y1='352.0' x2='360.0' y2='274.6' stroke='#f2b84b' stroke-width='2.5' /><line x1='630.0' y1='352.0' x2='463.1' y2='113.6' stroke='#f2b84b' stroke-width='2.5' /><line x1='450.0' y1='40.2' x2='557.0' y2='269.7' stroke='#f2b84b' stroke-width='2.5' /><line x1='450.0' y1='40.2' x2='360.0' y2='274.6' stroke='#f2b84b' stroke-width='2.5' /><line x1='270.0' y1='352.0' x2='463.1' y2='113.6' stroke='#f2b84b' stroke-width='2.5' /><circle cx='450.0' cy='300.4' r='8' fill='#f2b84b'/><circle cx='526.4' cy='204.0' r='8' fill='#f2b84b'/><circle cx='384.7' cy='210.4' r='8' fill='#f2b84b'/><circle cx='463.1' cy='113.6' r='7' fill='#eef2f7'/><circle cx='360.0' cy='274.6' r='7' fill='#eef2f7'/><circle cx='557.0' cy='269.7' r='7' fill='#eef2f7'/><text x='450.0' y='30.200000000000003' fill='#eef2f7' font-size='26' font-family='DejaVu Serif' font-style='italic' text-anchor='middle'>A</text><text x='250.0' y='372.0' fill='#eef2f7' font-size='26' font-family='DejaVu Serif' font-style='italic' text-anchor='middle'>B</text><text x='650.0' y='372.0' fill='#eef2f7' font-size='26' font-family='DejaVu Serif' font-style='italic' text-anchor='middle'>C</text><text x='450.0' y='340.4' fill='#f2b84b' font-size='26' font-family='DejaVu Serif' font-style='italic' text-anchor='middle'>A<tspan font-size='17' dy='6'>1</tspan></text><text x='566.4' y='208.0' fill='#f2b84b' font-size='26' font-family='DejaVu Serif' font-style='italic' text-anchor='middle'>B<tspan font-size='17' dy='6'>1</tspan></text><text x='344.7' y='214.4' fill='#f2b84b' font-size='26' font-family='DejaVu Serif' font-style='italic' text-anchor='middle'>C<tspan font-size='17' dy='6'>1</tspan></text><text x='429.1' y='117.6' fill='#eef2f7' font-size='26' font-family='DejaVu Serif' font-style='italic' text-anchor='middle'>A<tspan font-size='17' dy='6'>2</tspan></text><text x='348.0' y='308.6' fill='#eef2f7' font-size='26' font-family='DejaVu Serif' font-style='italic' text-anchor='middle'>B<tspan font-size='17' dy='6'>2</tspan></text><text x='571.0' y='303.7' fill='#eef2f7' font-size='26' font-family='DejaVu Serif' font-style='italic' text-anchor='middle'>C<tspan font-size='17' dy='6'>2</tspan></text></svg><p><b>Isbotlang:</b> agar <span class='m'>A<sub>1</sub>B<sub>1</sub>C<sub>1</sub></span> turli tomonli bo'lsa, <span class='m'>AA<sub>1</sub>A<sub>2</sub></span>, <span class='m'>BB<sub>1</sub>B<sub>2</sub></span>, <span class='m'>CC<sub>1</sub>C<sub>2</sub></span> uchburchaklariga tashqi chizilgan aylanalar <b>ikkita umumiy nuqtadan</b> o'tadi.</p>"
