      "body": "<p>Teng yonli uchburchaklarning asosidagi burchaklarni belgilaymiz: <span class='m'>∠A<sub>1</sub>BC = ∠A<sub>1</sub>CB = α</span>, xuddi shunday <span class='m'>β</span> (<span class='m'>CA</span> tomonda) va <span class='m'>γ</span> (<span class='m'>AB</span> tomonda).</p><p><span class='m'>∠BA<sub>1</sub>C = 180° − 2α</span>, shuning uchun shart quyidagiga teng:</p><div class='box'><span class='m'>540° − 2(α + β + γ) = 480°</span> ⇒ <span class='m'>α + β + γ = 30°</span></div><p>Endi <span class='m'>∠BA<sub>2</sub>C = 180° − (60° − γ) − (60° − β) = 90° − α</span> — bu <span class='m'>∠BA<sub>1</sub>C</span> ning aynan yarmi. <span class='m'>A<sub>1</sub></span> esa <span class='m'>BC</span> ning o'rta perpendikulyarida yotadi.</p><div class='box'><span class='m'>A<sub>1</sub></span> — <span class='m'>A<sub>2</sub>BC</span> uchburchakka tashqi chizilgan aylananing <b>markazi</b>. Shunga o'xshash <span class='m'>B<sub>1</sub></span>, <span class='m'>C<sub>1</sub></span>.</div>"
